        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global GLA Series Grade 2 Standard  Commercial Door Knobs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe GLA standard design commercial knobs are heavy duty Grade 2.  Fully adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-7/8\" thick doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI/BHMA A156.4, Series 4000, Grade 2. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of A label (3 hours) and less, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4'0\" x 8'0\"\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAslo Available: <a href=\"/products/grade-2-commercial-ball-knobset-global-svb-series\">Global SVB Series Grade 2 Commercial Ball Knobset</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Global GLA Series Commercial Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-7/8\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Standard 2-3/4\", Optional 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Case: Steel, Zinc dichromated resists corrosion, heavy duty spring cage.</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Thru-bolted: 5/16\" holes outside 2-1/8\" bore for anti-rotation.</li> -->\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" X 1-1/4\", curved lip (Standard ASA). </li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" throw stainless steel 3 hour UL rated.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: \"SUN\" Round Ball Knob.</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Keyways: SC1 \"C\" Standard (for keyed functions).</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin cylinder keyed to 6-pins (for keyed functions).</li> -->\r\n<li>Finish: Standard <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Manufactures Warranty: Lifetime Mechanical - 10 Year Finish</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet)(ANSI F75-2): Latchbolt operated by knob from either side at all times. For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom)(ANSI F76-2): Latchbolt operated by knob from either side or emergency release in outside knob. Outside locked by push button on inside knob. Outside knob unlocked by emergency release in outside knob, rotating inside knob or closing door. </li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>This item is discontinued.</b> Limited supply available. <b>Please Use <a href=\"/products/grade-2-commercial-ball-knobset-global-svb-series\">Global SVB Series Grade 2 Commercial Ball Knobset</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Standard Commercial Knobsets, Global GLA Series",
                "description": "Global commercial door knobsets that are heavy duty Grade 2  with Vandal Resistant free wheeling Clutch mechanism. Available in a wide selection of functions, fully adjustable for 1-3/8 to 1-7/8 thick doors.",
